[statement]
apk reads the repositories' names in the order it is given the
repositories: `au`, in the second, is read after `xp`, in the first, and
comes first of the two, which share a bucket.

[repository]
P:base
V:1

P:xp
V:1
i:base

[repository]
P:au
V:1
i:base

[request]
base

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
install base 1
install au 1
install xp 1
